The data this plugin reads are the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve
System's: its H.10 and H.15 releases and its staff's nominal yield curve
(Gurkaynak, Sack and Wright, FEDS 2006-28), which the Board publishes as
public domain. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Federal Reserve. The responses under src/fed_board/responses/ are the Board's
pages as received on 2026-10-10, and its H.15 and zero curve files as
received on 2026-10-23, trimmed to their last weeks.

This plugin was published as plugin-fed-h10 until 0.6.0.
